(2232,'quills_wholesale_paragraph_3','Answer a few questions below to get your samples. I\'ll reach out to talk through your coffee program and arrange a free sample box.','auto'),
(2233,'quills_wholesale_form_success_message','Thank you! Michael will review your details and reach out soon with sample box arrangements.','auto'),
