class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span>                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"quills-review-count\">\n                        (No reviews)                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-price\">$23.00</div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n                <article class=\"quills-coffee-card\" data-product-id=\"57\">\n            <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-media\">\n                <a href=\"http://localhost:8000/product/colombia-el-paraiso/\" class=\"quills-coffee-card-link\" aria-label=\"Colombia | El Paraiso\">\n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8000/wp-content/uploads/quills/DSC05126.jpg\" alt=\"Colombia | El Paraiso\" class=\"quills-coffee-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"rollover_inner\" data-permalink=\"http://localhost:8000/product/colombia-el-paraiso/\">\n                    <div class=\"rollover_wrapper\">\n                        <a href=\"http://localhost:8000/product/colombia-el-paraiso/\" class=\"rollover_link_overlay\" aria-label=\"Colombia | El Paraiso\">\n                            <div class=\"rollover_top\">\n                                <span class=\"collection_name\"></span>\n                                <h4 class=\"prod_title\">Colombia | El Paraiso</h4>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"rollover_content\">\n                                <div class=\"rte\">\n                                    <div class=\"metafield-rich_text_field\">\n                                                                                    <p><em><strong>white peach, jasmine, meyer lemon, honey<br><br></strong></em>\n                                                                                                                                        <strong>Process: </strong>Honey<br>\n                                                                                                                                        <strong>Origins: </strong>Cauca, Colombia                                                                                        </p>\n                                                                            </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"rollover_short\"></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                        <div class=\"rollover_bottom\">\n                            <button type=\"button\" class=\"quills-hover-add-cart\" data-product-id=\"57\" data-permalink=\"http://localhost:8000/product/colombia-el-paraiso/\" aria-label=\"Add Colombia | El Paraiso to cart\">ADD TO CART</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-content\">\n                <h3 class=\"quills-coffee-card-title\">\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8000/product/colombia-el-paraiso/\">Colombia | El Paraiso</a>\n                </h3>\n                <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-rating\">\n                    <span class=\"quills-stars\">\n                        <span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span>                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"quills-review-count\">\n                        (No reviews)                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-price\">FROM $26.00</div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n                <article class=\"quills-coffee-card\" data-product-id=\"83\">\n            <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-media\">\n                <a href=\"http://localhost:8000/product/sunrise-sunset/\" class=\"quills-coffee-card-link\" aria-label=\"Sunrise &amp; Sunset\">\n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8000/wp-content/uploads/quills/DSC00650.jpg\" alt=\"Sunrise &amp; Sunset\" class=\"quills-coffee-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"rollover_inner\" data-permalink=\"http://localhost:8000/product/sunrise-sunset/\">\n                    <div class=\"rollover_wrapper\">\n                        <a href=\"http://localhost:8000/product/sunrise-sunset/\" class=\"rollover_link_overlay\" aria-label=\"Sunrise &amp; Sunset\">\n                            <div class=\"rollover_top\">\n                                <span class=\"collection_name\"></span>\n                                <h4 class=\"prod_title\">Sunrise &amp; Sunset</h4>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"rollover_content\">\n                                <div class=\"rte\">\n                                    <div class=\"metafield-rich_text_field\">\n                                                                                    <p>Our signature house blend Inkwell and Decaf de Caña.</p>\n                                                                            </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"rollover_short\"></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                        <div class=\"rollover_bottom\">\n                            <button type=\"button\" class=\"quills-hover-add-cart\" data-product-id=\"83\" data-permalink=\"http://localhost:8000/product/sunrise-sunset/\" aria-label=\"Add Sunrise &amp; Sunset to cart\">ADD TO CART</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-content\">\n                <h3 class=\"quills-coffee-card-title\">\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8000/product/sunrise-sunset/\">Sunrise &amp; Sunset</a>\n                </h3>\n                <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-rating\">\n                    <span class=\"quills-stars\">\n                        <span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span><span class=\"quills-star--empty\">☆</span>                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"quills-review-count\">\n                        (No reviews)                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"quills-coffee-card-price\">$44.00</div>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n        				</div>\n\n			</div>\n		</div>\n\n		<div class=\"quills-separator-line quills-separator-line--bottom\"></div>\n\n		<!-- Customer Testimonial Bottom Banner (Matching Screenshot 4) -->\n		<section class=\"quills-coffee-testimonials-banner\" aria-label=\"Customer Testimonials\">\n			<div class=\"quills-testimonials-inner\">\n				<h2 class=\"quills-testimonials-heading\">\n					More kind words from customersaaa				</h2>\n				<div class=\"quills-testimonials-stars\">\n					<span class=\"quills-gold-star\">★</span>\n					<span class=\"quills-gold-star\">★</span>\n					<span class=\"quills-gold-star\">★</span>\n					<span class=\"quills-gold-star\">★</span>\n					<span class=\"quills-gold-star\">★</span>\n				</div>\n				<blockquote class=\"quills-testimonials-quote\" id=\"quills-bottom-quote-text\">\n					\"Amazing coffee. Quills is consistently head and shoulders above others.\"\n				</blockquote>\n\n				<div class=\"quills-slider-dots\">\n					<button type=\"button\" class=\"quills-slider-dot is-active\" data-bottom-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Customer 1\"></button>\n					<button type=\"button\" class=\"quills-slider-dot\" data-bottom-index=\"1\" aria-label=\"Customer 2\"></button>\n					<button type=\"button\" class=\"quills-slider-dot\" data-bottom-index=\"2\" aria-label=\"Customer 3\"></button>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n		</section>\n\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"coffee-cafe-corner\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->','Page Coffee','','publish','closed','closed','','page-coffee','','','2026-10-23 01:57:15','2026-10-23 01:57:15','',0,'http://localhost:8000/page-coffee/',0,'wp_template','',0);
